{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50096","headline":"海阳湖 · 无名氏","name":"海阳湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲游爱湖广，湖广丛怪石。\n回合万里势，□□□□□。\n绿动若无底，波澄涵云碧。\n熔水复何如，昆池吾不易。\n兹境多所尚，亲邻道与释。\n外望虽异门，中间不相隔。\n开凿尽天然，智者留奇迹。\n我愿长此游，谁言一朝夕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50096.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50096","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}